                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="430 1583 430 1601 2196 1597 2198 1579 2194 1552 428 1550 430 1583"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="losing a part of their herds, has succeeded in allaying the misfortune and in"/>
